New Expiry: ${validate_keystore.artifacts.cert_expiry}
Days Remaining: ${validate_keystore.artifacts.cert_days_remaining}
Subject: ${validate_keystore.artifacts.cert_subject}
Renewal Job: https://aaponprem.chrislab.dev/execution/jobs/playbook/${renew_keystore.artifacts.renewal_job_id}/output
